[agent] **Features engineered** (classic fraud signals): per-card transaction velocity (`cnt_1h`, `cnt_24h`, `sum_1h`, `time_since_last_sec`), haversine geo-distance from each card's usual location, amount anomaly vs. the card's history (`amt_z`, `amt_over_card_mean`), hour/night/day-of-week signals, and smoothed target encodings for `category`/`merchant` (fit on labelled history only, applied leak-free to the scoring set).
